\section{Tuning}{

Every parameter lives in the two configuration lists; change them with
\code{\link[=om_config_update]{om_config_update()}} (or the \code{...} of \code{\link[=om_biomass_config]{om_biomass_config()}} /
\code{\link[=om_fishery_config]{om_fishery_config()}}). The spatial domain can be any ICCAT stock area
(\code{\link[=om_domain_iccat]{om_domain_iccat()}}, \code{\link[=iccat_stocks]{iccat_stocks()}}), an ICCAT-like GeoPackage
(\code{\link[=om_domain_from_gpkg]{om_domain_from_gpkg()}}) or a synthetic grid (\code{\link[=om_domain_grid]{om_domain_grid()}});
regions are free latitudinal bands (\code{\link[=classify_regions]{classify_regions()}}).
}

\section{Reproducibility}{

Each stochastic component has its own seed; simulations never change
the caller's random stream. \code{\link[=om_compare_reference]{om_compare_reference()}} checks a run
against the reference files of Experimento 02.
}

